   *[other] Moved { $count } items.
}
workbench-paste-nothing = There are no files to paste.
workbench-error-nothing-selected = Nothing is selected.
workbench-error-no-such-file = { $path } does not exist.
workbench-error-no-image = The active tab is not an image.
workbench-error-zoom = Give a zoom action or a scale.
workbench-error-delete = Cannot delete { $path }: { $error }
workbench-deleted = { $count ->
